  },
  "body": "1. Instead of subtracting a magic number, do a bitwise AND to pick a number of least-significant bits that makes sense if you consider the UTF-8 bytes bitwise.\n2. Instead of shifting by variable amounts in order to put all bits into their final destination directly, always shift by a constant six and let the higher bits be shifted a number of times.\n",
